# The golden prompts must keep their exact bytes.
#
# Both .md files arrived with LF endings only. On Windows, git's default would
# hand them back as CRLF at checkout. That silently changes the text of a file
# nobody is allowed to change, and it breaks `prompts.test.ts`, which compares
# the generated module against the source byte for byte.
#
# Pinned narrowly, on purpose. A repo-wide `* text=auto` would renormalise every
# file here and bury real work in a whitespace diff.
api/prompts/librarian.md text eol=lf
api/prompts/scribe.md text eol=lf
api/prompts/text.ts text eol=lf
scripts/build-prompts.mjs text eol=lf
